  "title": "Wildpaw Explorer",
  "date": "2025-03-05",
  "excerpt": "The Wildpaw Explorer is a custom-built Mercedes Sprinter 170 AWD camper van designed for off-grid travel and adventure with your four-legged companion. Built for durability and comfort, this van is powered by an 800Ah li",
  "body": [
    "The Wildpaw Explorer is a custom-built Mercedes Sprinter 170 AWD camper van designed for off-grid travel and adventure with your four-legged companion. Built for durability and comfort, this van is powered by an 800Ah lithium battery system, a 400W solar array, and a 3000W pure sine wave inverter, ensuring reliable energy for extended journeys. With multiple 110V outlets, USB-A and USB-C ports, and a shore power connection, staying connected and powered up on the road is effortless.",
    "This van is equipped for all-season travel with a premium insulation package, a 12V Nomadic X2 air conditioning unit, a Maxxair Deluxe ceiling vent fan, and an Espar diesel heater, keeping the interior comfortable no matter the conditions. The sleek yet functional interior features painted shiplap walls, a wood-stained ceiling, dimmable LED lighting, and durable vinyl wood-style flooring. With five overhead cabinets, a floor-to-ceiling closet, and rear door storage panels, the Wildpaw Explorer maximizes storage without compromising space. A custom-built bench seat with a pullout dog bed provides the perfect place for your pup to relax after a long day of adventure.",
    "The kitchen is designed for both convenience and efficiency, featuring an acacia butcher block countertop with a pop-up extension, an undermount stainless steel sink with hot and cold water, and a portable single-burner induction cooktop stored neatly under the counter. The Isotherm Cruise 130 refrigerator with a freezer and a 700W microwave add essential functionality while keeping the layout minimal and practical. A tiled backsplash enhances the aesthetic, blending modern design with rugged durability.",
    "For those who love to explore off-grid, the Wildpaw Explorer comes equipped with an indoor wet-bath shower, a Laveo dry flush toilet, and a rear outdoor shower with hot and cold water, making cleanup after a day on the trails easy. The roof rack with a side ladder, an electric awning, and an exterior perimeter lighting package with a light bar enhance the van’s outdoor capabilities, ensuring you’re prepared for any adventure.",
    "Built for those who seek freedom on the open road, this Mercedes Sprinter camper van offers the perfect blend of functionality and adventure-ready features. If you're looking for a custom-built camper van tailored to your travel style, reach out to us today to start designing your dream build."
  ],
